    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d571">

                <pb facs="0582" n="416" xml:id="pg416"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 337.11/216</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gonzales to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-02T21:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 2, 1917, 9 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s March 1, 7 p.m. According to wireless from the Commander of U. S. S.
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Eagle</hi>, Central Senado, Camaguey Province,
                    burned. Government information is that Santa Lucia, Oriente Province, and Por
                    Fuerza, Matanzas Province, all right. Santa Maria, Oriente Province, is in rebel
                    zone and no information procurable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
